# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only the files worth
# backing up. Session logs, caches, and anything token-like stay OUT.
*
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!settings.json
!hooks/
!hooks/**
!git-hooks/
!git-hooks/**
!project-template/
!project-template/**
!skills/
!skills/**
# Memory notes under projects/ are NOT backed up: their folder names carry your home path, which
# the privacy check in git-hooks/pre-commit refuses (see INSTALL.md). projects/ stays ignored whole.
